    html: "<ul class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-4\">\n      <li class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-0.5 text-amber-500\">\n            <span class=\"sr-only\">Rated 4 out of 5 stars</span>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4 text-gray-200\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700\">\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-3.5\"\n            >\n              <path\n                fill-rule=\"evenodd\"\n                d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.857-9.809a.75.75 0 00-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 10-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 001.137-.089l4-5.5z\"\n                clip-rule=\"evenodd\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            Verified purchase\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\">Kept us dry through a week of rain</p>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n          Pitched this in a downpour at 6,000ft and stayed dry all night. Poles are colour-coded so\n          it went up in under four minutes even in the wind.\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-gray-500\">Freya Lindqvist &middot; 3 weeks ago</p>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"rounded-lg border border-gray-200 p-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-0.5 text-amber-500\">\n            <span class=\"sr-only\">Rated 3 out of 5 stars</span>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4 text-gray-200\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n            <svg\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\n              fill=\"currentColor\"\n              class=\"size-4 text-gray-200\"\n            >\n              <path\n                d=\"M10 1.5l2.6 5.27 5.82.85-4.21 4.1.99 5.8L10 14.9l-5.2 2.62.99-5.8-4.21-4.1 5.82-.85z\"\n              />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\">Good pack, straps run narrow</p>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n          Compression straps and the hip belt are excellent, but the shoulder straps dug in on\n          longer days. Sizing up helped.\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-gray-500\">Owen Baptiste &middot; 2 months ago</p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>",
